;==================================================
;扩展更多特有COUNTER
;==================================================
;将上方COUNTER1函数名中的"COUNTER1_"替换为"COUNTER2_"即可创建第2个特有COUNTER。
;最多支持到COUNTER5。
;
;函数名完整对照：
;   @UNIQUE_COUNTER1_ABLE_KX_XXX         → @UNIQUE_COUNTER2_ABLE_KX_XXX
;   @UNIQUE_COUNTER1_FREQUENCY_KX_XXX    → @UNIQUE_COUNTER2_FREQUENCY_KX_XXX
;   @UNIQUE_COUNTER1_MESSAGE_KX_XXX      → @UNIQUE_COUNTER2_MESSAGE_KX_XXX
;   @UNIQUE_COUNTER1_SOURCE_KX_XXX       → @UNIQUE_COUNTER2_SOURCE_KX_XXX
